WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,410
My family said it first

2
00:00:02,410 --> 00:00:05,210
The weasel that was crushed to death was his cousin.

3
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:06,810
That's your Huang Dachui

4
00:00:06,810 --> 00:00:09,010
This man's name is Lu Yunyang, he's a gangster.

5
00:00:09,010 --> 00:00:10,610
He's almost 40 and still fooling around outside.

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,010
His father can’t live at home, but he travels and makes money

7
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,810
Just what happened in the middle of the night a few days ago

8
00:00:13,810 --> 00:00:16,410
He lowered his head to look at his cell phone and then raised his head

9
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,810
In front of the car stood an inhuman group of four people.

10
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:21,410
He turned the steering wheel but still ran him over.

11
00:00:21,410 --> 00:00:23,410
How did he know it was a weasel he was crushing?

12
00:00:23,410 --> 00:00:25,610
The car hit a tree and the headlight was shattered.

13
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,810
When he got out of the car, he saw it was a weasel.

14
00:00:27,810 --> 00:00:29,010
Got angry

15
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,810
I reversed the car and ran it over a few times before leaving.

16
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:32,410
Deliberately grinding teeth

17
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,610
Then one life is worth one's life

18
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:35,810
Begging for mercy from the weasel who wants to change his life

19
00:00:35,810 --> 00:00:37,500
not found

20
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,500
Then we can only let him die Liu Daxian

21
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,700
I've judged you here

22
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:44,600
Quanzi is upstairs

23
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:46,000
Your son is sick

24
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,230
It's been a few days since I took it off

25
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:50,030
The great immortals in the city found a few

26
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:51,230
The more I look at it, the more important it becomes

27
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:52,820
Can't turn on the light

28
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:58,820
Otherwise

29
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:02,250
I didn't mean Yunyang

30
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,450
Yunyang, don’t move
